 they're  experiencing inflation about 7.9 but the  poorest 10th over here look much higher  experiencing inflation of around 11  this research also found there's a big  difference in cost between the lowest  value items and the next lowest cost  versions it really shows how careful  less well of shoppers are needing to be
 

